{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A confirmed merge can be reported as needing review or having unknown PR state when the saved observation lags."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A new PR head can invalidate approval without causing the digest to report the renewed review need."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The digest directs an agent to review a PR while its requested changes are still running."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A historical landing blocker masks a closed PR and prompts a retry that the queue refuses."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An unreadable privacy policy allows mutations to succeed while hiding their receipts, potentially causing duplicate submissions."},{"id":"C6","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An unavailable privacy policy makes the status tool return success without the requested state or next action."},{"id":"C7","consequence":"diag","trigger":"unusual","reason":"Unicode formatting controls can affect terminal display, but the reproduced output retains the quoted data boundary and demonstrates no further effect."},{"id":"C8","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A valid approval is reported as needing review when no PR snapshot has yet been saved."},{"id":"C10","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The digest advertises a review during an unfinished run even though the review API refuses it."},{"id":"C11","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A nonexistent run produces an inaccurate HTTP error classification while still returning an accurate error message."},{"id":"C12","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"Following the Codex skill's documented command reads Claude's consumer cursor and can omit work from the digest."},{"id":"C13","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A malformed successful backend response is passed to the agent as a successful review or land receipt."}]}